SUMMARY:(ATTIC): 𝓜𝓪𝓻𝓲𝓪’𝓼 𝓓𝓮𝓫𝓾𝓽 (screening) 
DTSTAMP:20260730T054912Z
DTSTART:20260730T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:FREE | 7pm - 10pm | +21 | ATTIC<br>for the final time\, 𝓜𝓪𝓻𝓲𝓪’𝓼
	 𝓓𝓮𝓫𝓾𝓽 will be screening this thursday at 7:00pm upstairs at <a href="http
	s://www.instagram.com/axelradhouston/">@axelradhouston</a>!<br><br>thank y
	ou to houston consortium for analog research (h.c.a.r. - <a href="https://
	www.instagram.com/nostalgic_miasma/">@nostalgic_miasma</a>) for getting 𝓜𝓪
	𝓻𝓲𝓪’𝓼 𝓓𝓮𝓫𝓾𝓽 on a vhs tape and keeping analog alive! show up this thursday 
	for a chance to win one of the only two copies in the world - no purchase 
	necessary!<br>*****<br>as a treat and an honor to enjoy feminine relations
	hips\, start the night off by getting your hair braided by <a href="https:
	//www.instagram.com/braidsbyaurora/">@braidsbyaurora</a> for free! libre! 
	gratis! ✶⋆.*:･<br><br>continue the night of highlighting immigrants and po
	c women with a educational discussion and variety show before the short fi
	lm.<br><br>𝓑𝓪𝓫𝓪𝓵𝓲𝓴 𝓚𝓪 𝓑𝓪?: 𝓢𝓮𝓻𝓿𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓽𝓱𝓮 𝓶𝓸𝓽𝓱𝓮𝓻𝓵𝓪𝓷𝓭 will be a discussion on 
	first-hand accounts of matriarchal migrations of filipino women and how th
	at ties into the film. then we will be follow up with a brilliant line of 
	performers below:<br>✶⋆.*:･❀<br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/1.800ba
	dbitch/">@1.800badbitch</a><br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/brooklyn
	babe999/">@brooklynbabe999</a><br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/themo
	onistrans/">@themoonistrans</a><br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/cami
	lle.closer/">@camille.closer</a><br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/reg
	ine.gwyneth/">@regine.gwyneth</a><br>✶⋆.*:･❀<br><br>⋆ ⛪︎ ˖ 𝓜𝓪𝓻𝓲𝓪’𝓼 𝓓𝓮𝓫𝓾𝓽 ˖ 
	⛪︎ ⋆<br>LAST SCREENING EVER!<br>⋆ ⛪︎ ˖ [21+] ˖ ⛪︎ ⋆<br><br>axelrad beer garde
	n<br>˖ ⛪︎ ⋆ upstairs ˖ ⛪︎ ⋆<br>1517 alabama street<br>free braids at 7:00pm\
	, show at 8:00pm\n\nFrom Axelrad Beer Garden
